WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:02.628
The Eloquent Peasant.

00:00:02.711 --> 00:00:05.797
It's some sort of ancient document
from old Egyptian times.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:07.216
It's gone.

00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:11.595
It's a mystery. We like mysteries.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.140
What's happening?

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:22.189
These characters seem like
they're from The Wizard of Oz.

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.398
So you'll help us find the Wizard?

00:00:23.482 --> 00:00:27.069
And maybe some antacid?
My stomach is a little iffy.

00:00:29.071 --> 00:00:29.905
Woah.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.740
Maybe it's some sort of clue.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:32.866
Look.

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:36.995
We're dealing with a ghost.

00:00:37.079 --> 00:00:37.871
Rad.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:40.123
Please just tell me where I am.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:43.001
There's a ghost. He's releasing
fictional characters into our world

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:44.378
to help us solve a mystery.

00:00:45.128 --> 00:00:46.213
Wanna see the big picture?

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:49.591
Look at things from a different angle.

00:00:50.092 --> 00:00:50.717
Woah.

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:54.471
Hey, buddy.
How about getting me outta here?

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:56.181
The Mouse and the Motorcycle.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.016
Meet Rainbow.

00:00:58.100 --> 00:00:59.810
She can shapeshift into different people.

00:01:01.395 --> 00:01:03.480
I'm Wilbur, and I'm terrific.
Right, Charlotte?

00:01:03.564 --> 00:01:04.648
We have to hurry.

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:05.774
We can't give up.

00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:07.609
It's brave young people like you

00:01:08.277 --> 00:01:09.778
that make the world a better place.

00:01:14.283 --> 00:01:16.285
-Did you guys finish reading the book?
-Loved it.

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:18.245
-Me too, the ending--
-I’m not finished yet!

00:01:18.662 --> 00:01:19.621
No spoilers please.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:20.914
Whoo!

